        "text_6qF6dH": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Since 1971, Arader Galleries has been the world's leading dealer and auction house of Rare Maps, Prints, Rare Books, Manuscripts and Watercolors of the 16th through 19th centuries.</p><p>Over our fifty-four year history, we have grown to three illustrious locations in New York, Philadelphia, and Napa Valley. We are represented at the most distinguished antiques shows in the country and are proud to buy and sell more original Audubon prints than any other firm in the United States.</p><p>This partnership opportunity allows you to establish your presence within one of the most respected galleries in the art world, at one of Manhattan's most coveted addresses.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
